note VSS 3.1 Concurrency - Hardware Thread Inspection

make cpu_count becomes concurrency_hardware_threads()

say "System Hardware Concurrency (Logical CPU Cores): " + cpu_count

when cpu_count above 3
    say "Multi-core CPU detected. VSS worker pool optimized for parallel execution."
otherwise
    say "Standard CPU core allocation active."
finish

say "Hardware Thread Query Completed Successfully!"
